    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.poster.avif?t=1755244950\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.webm?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.mp4?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nezori is a lighthearted action RPG set in a world inhabited by fox girls and wolf girls. When the young fox girl Atsuko learns of the legendary hot springs long since forgotten by her people, she sets out on a quest to find it by exploring the territory of the wolf-like Sothiens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atsuko is determined to reach the hot springs, even if it means battling every Sothien who stands in her way. Yet the secrets of their world run deeper than anyone knows, and as she clashes with the Sothiens, her quest might reveal much more than she ever expected.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.poster.avif?t=1755244950\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.webm?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.mp4?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted story as Atsuko fights to prove herself to the opposing Sothiens and find the legendary hot springs.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively cast of characters ranging from adorable fox girls to deadly wolf girls.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action combat with a variety of abilities and special attacks to defeat the enemies that stand in your way.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 3D environments to explore in search of treasures and secrets.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/3264d3fa417d605923a3e4013eec716c.avif?t=1755244950\" width=644 height=588 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/aedd5e9c1e58a6ac09bac0a04ed2936b.avif?t=1755244950\" width=644 height=577 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/b80924d84a6ac291595466c0bfb1b2a6.avif?t=1755244950\" width=644 height=595 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/edf7bbf7daa0b69061347372c12b6711.avif?t=1755244950\" width=661 height=624 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.poster.avif?t=1755244950\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.webm?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/7b141a21753e6053367ff96db625ce79.mp4?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nezori is a lighthearted action RPG set in a world inhabited by fox girls and wolf girls. When the young fox girl Atsuko learns of the legendary hot springs long since forgotten by her people, she sets out on a quest to find it by exploring the territory of the wolf-like Sothiens.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Atsuko is determined to reach the hot springs, even if it means battling every Sothien who stands in her way. Yet the secrets of their world run deeper than anyone knows, and as she clashes with the Sothiens, her quest might reveal much more than she ever expected.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.poster.avif?t=1755244950\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.webm?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/e33dfd574e60f97376de20446c9059db.mp4?t=1755244950\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong>\u00a0</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Lighthearted story as Atsuko fights to prove herself to the opposing Sothiens and find the legendary hot springs.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A lively cast of characters ranging from adorable fox girls to deadly wolf girls.\u00a0\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Action combat with a variety of abilities and special attacks to defeat the enemies that stand in your way.\u00a0</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautiful 3D environments to explore in search of treasures and secrets.\u00a0</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/3264d3fa417d605923a3e4013eec716c.avif?t=1755244950\" width=644 height=588 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/aedd5e9c1e58a6ac09bac0a04ed2936b.avif?t=1755244950\" width=644 height=577 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/b80924d84a6ac291595466c0bfb1b2a6.avif?t=1755244950\" width=644 height=595 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3824840/extras/edf7bbf7daa0b69061347372c12b6711.avif?t=1755244950\" width=661 height=624 /></span></p>",
